{"ticker":"TSLA","updated":"2026-11-14T01:29:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Tesla, Inc.","shortName":"Tesla, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.tesla.com","fullTimeEmployees":134785,"marketCap":1542445203456,"trailingPE":428.81317,"forwardPE":180.72267,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":14.89278,"pegRatio":4.64,"targetMeanPrice":412.47626,"targetHighPrice":600.0,"targetLowPrice":128.11,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":40,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.002,"earningsGrowth":-0.436,"grossMargins":0.19285999,"operatingMargins":0.03026,"profitMargins":0.031070001,"totalRevenue":103569997824,"beta":1.743,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":498.83,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":297.38,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Tesla, Inc. designs, develops, manufactures, leases, and sells electric vehicles, and energy generation and storage systems in the United States, China, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Automotive; and Energy Generation and Storage. The company offers electric vehicles, as well as sells automotive regulatory credits; and non-warranty maintenance services and collision, automotive insurance services, as well as part sales and retail merchandise sale. It also provides sedans and sport utility vehicles through direct and used vehicle sales, a network of Tesla Superchargers, and in-app upgrades; purchase financing and leasing services; services for electric vehicles through its company-owned service locations and Tesla mobile service technicians; and vehicle limited warranties and extended service plans. In addition, the company engages in the design, manufacture, installation, sale, and leasing of solar energy generation and energy storage products, and related services to residential, commercial, and industrial customers and utilities through its website, stores, and galleries, as well as through a network of channel partners. Further, it provides services and repairs to its energy product customers, including under warranty and extended service plans; and various financing options to its residential customers; lithium-ion battery energy storage products","summary_zh":"特斯拉公司在美國、中國和國際上設計、開發、製造、租賃和銷售電動車以及能源發電和儲存系統。該公司分為兩個部門：汽車部門；以及能源生產和儲存。該公司提供電動車，並銷售汽車監管積分；和非保固維修服務和碰撞、汽車保險服務，以及零件銷售和零售商品銷售。它還透過直接銷售和二手車銷售、特斯拉超級充電站網路以及應用程式內升級來提供轎車和運動型多用途車；購買融資和租賃服務；透過公司自有的服務地點和特斯拉移動服務技術人員為電動車提供服務；以及車輛有限保固和延長服務計劃。此外，該公司還透過其網站、商店和畫廊以及通路合作夥伴網路，從事太陽能發電和儲能產品的設計、製造、安裝、銷售和租賃，以及為住宅、商業和工業客戶和公用事業提供相關服務。此外，它還為其能源產品客戶提供服務和維修，包括保固和延長服務計劃；以及為住宅客戶提供的各種融資選擇；鋰離子電池儲能產品","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車製造商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":423.13,"h":425.7,"l":402.43,"c":410.04,"v":163823700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":414.5,"h":423.25,"l":411.43,"c":421.62,"v":104285700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":415.75,"h":428.31,"l":409.67,"c":425.86,"v":106133500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":428.87,"h":432.22,"l":416.56,"c":416.85,"v":90454500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":421.82,"h":429.47,"l":421.72,"c":426.07,"v":93131000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":431.11,"h":444.98,"l":429.13,"c":434.21,"v":97108800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":439.88,"h":440.97,"l":423.72,"c":425.85,"v":83422700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":429.83,"h":444.21,"l":429.03,"c":442.79,"v":93133600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":435.24,"h":435.35,"l":419.08,"c":423.39,"v":96746400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":428.3,"h":440.47,"l":421.02,"c":440.4,"v":101628200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":444.35,"h":450.98,"l":439.5,"c":443.21,"v":79491500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":441.52,"h":445.0,"l":433.12,"c":444.72,"v":74358000},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":443.8,"h":462.29,"l":440.75,"c":459.46,"v":98122300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":470.54,"h":470.75,"l":435.57,"c":436.0,"v":137009000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":443.29,"h":446.77,"l":416.58,"c":429.83,"v":133188200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":440.75,"h":453.55,"l":436.69,"c":453.25,"v":85324900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":447.82,"h":452.68,"l":432.45,"c":433.09,"v":102296100},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":437.57,"h":441.33,"l":4